cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Drug Matching Benchmark: explicit risk control for linking FDA NDC drug products to RxNorm"
abstract: >-
  An open, preregistered benchmark for linking FDA National Drug Code (NDC)
  product descriptions to RxNorm semantic clinical drug (SCD) concepts, with
  10% of the concepts removed from the catalog. It includes a rule-based
  candidate generator, calibrated scoring models, four rules for setting an
  automatic-acceptance threshold at a 95% precision target (point, Wilson,
  Learn then Test, and selection with guaranteed risk), comparisons with RxNav
  and SapBERT, preregistrations, frozen splits, and all results. Public data
  only: openFDA NDC Directory and RxNorm Current Prescribable Content.
